From: Ifran Ali <khanu.i.i.k.2000@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] phy: hook up the GalaChip GC1601 PON SerDes driver

Build drivers/phy/galachip, which holds the PON SerDes driver of the
GC1601.

Signed-off-by: Ifran Ali <khanu.i.i.k.2000@gmail.com>
---
--- a/drivers/phy/Kconfig
+++ b/drivers/phy/Kconfig
@@ -128,6 +128,7 @@
 source "drivers/phy/broadcom/Kconfig"
 source "drivers/phy/cadence/Kconfig"
 source "drivers/phy/freescale/Kconfig"
+source "drivers/phy/galachip/Kconfig"
 source "drivers/phy/hisilicon/Kconfig"
 source "drivers/phy/ingenic/Kconfig"
 source "drivers/phy/lantiq/Kconfig"
--- a/drivers/phy/Makefile
+++ b/drivers/phy/Makefile
@@ -20,6 +20,7 @@
 					   broadcom/	\
 					   cadence/	\
 					   freescale/	\
+					   galachip/	\
 					   hisilicon/	\
 					   ingenic/	\
 					   intel/	\
